{
  "label": "Action Request",
  "category": "Alert Acquirer",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Action Request Management",
      "id": "action-request",
      "intro": "Tab Action Request pada Alert Details Dialog digunakan untuk mengelola permintaan tindakan (seperti pemblokiran kartu, klasifikasi fraud, eskalasi) yang terkait dengan alert tersebut. Fitur ini memungkinkan proses approval berlapis sebelum tindakan benar-benar dieksekusi oleh sistem.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Tampilan Tabel & Filter Status",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Menampilkan daftar request dalam bentuk tabel (`AppDataView`)\n• **Toolbar Atas:** Terdapat filter status `Open` dan `Closed` untuk beralih antara request aktif dan histori request.\n• **Kolom Data:** \n  - `Request Name` (ID + Nama + Tanggal Generate + Pembuat)\n  - `Status` (Status dari flow approval, misal PENDING, APPROVED, REJECTED)\n  - `Action Type` (Jenis tindakan, misal CLASSIFY ALERT)\n• Klik baris request untuk melihat panel detail di sebelah kanan layar.",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(59,130,246,.15);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;\"><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:900;color:#0f172a;\">Action Request</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">Monitor alerts generated by the acquirer</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;\"><button style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:8px;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;border:none;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/></svg>Open</button><button style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:8px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#64748b;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12\"/></svg>Closed</button></div></div><div style=\"background:#f8fafc;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 120px 140px;padding:10px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;gap:12px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:800;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;\">Request Name</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:800;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;\">Status</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:800;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;\">Action Type</div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 120px 140px;padding:16px 20px;align-items:center;gap:12px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\"><div style=\"width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:8px;background:#fffbeb;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">#102 - Suspect Fraud Action</div><div style=\"font-size:9.5px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">Generated on 15/06/2025 10:00 by admin</div></div></div><div><span style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">PENDING CHECKER 1</span></div><div><span style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#e0f2fe;color:#0369a1;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;border:1px solid #bae6fd;\">Classify Alert</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Membuat / Mengedit Request",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Syarat Akses:** Anda harus memiliki role yang sesuai (cek `ADD_ALERT_ACQUIRER_ACTION_REQUEST`) dan alert tidak boleh sedang di-lock oleh analis lain.\n• **Tombol Add Request / Edit Request:** Tersedia di menu actions toolbar (titik tiga di sudut kanan atas header tabel).\n• **Proses:** Membuka dialog form untuk menentukan `Action Type` dan memberikan alasan/catatan (remarks) untuk permintaan tersebut.",
          "color": "#10b981",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.08);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;width:240px;background:#fff;\"><div style=\"padding:8px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;cursor:pointer;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"/><line x1=\"21\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"16.65\" y2=\"16.65\"/></svg>Search</div><div style=\"height:1px;background:#f1f5f9;margin:4px 0;\"></div><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#eff6ff;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#2563eb;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;cursor:pointer;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg>Add Request</div><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;cursor:pointer;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M11 4H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-7\"/><path d=\"M18.5 2.5a2.121 2.121 0 0 1 3 3L12 15l-4 1 1-4 9.5-9.5z\"/></svg>Edit Request</div><div style=\"height:1px;background:#f1f5f9;margin:4px 0;\"></div><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;cursor:pointer;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M9 11l3 3L22 4\"/><path d=\"M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11\"/></svg>Approval</div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Approval / Penolakan Request",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Tombol Approval:** Digunakan oleh User Checker untuk mengevaluasi request yang diajukan oleh Maker.\n• Saat diklik, akan muncul Action Approval Dialog yang memuat ringkasan permintaan.\n• User dapat menekan **Approve** (menyetujui & mengeksekusi tindakan, misal alert otomatis menjadi Classified) atau **Decline** (menolak permintaan).\n• Setelah diproses, status request akan berpindah ke tab `Closed`.",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.15);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;width:340px;background:#fff;\"><div style=\"padding:16px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;margin-bottom:4px;\">Action Approval Review</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#64748b;\">Please review the request details below.</div></div><div style=\"padding:20px;background:#f8fafc;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:2px;\">Action Type</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">CLASSIFY_ALERT (Fraud)</div></div><div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:2px;\">Maker Remarks</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#475569;\">Indikasi kuat fraud, histori transaksi mencurigakan. Mohon klasifikasi sebagai POSITIVE.</div></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:16px 20px;border-top:1px solid #f1f5f9;display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:flex-end;\"><button style=\"padding:8px 16px;border-radius:8px;background:#fee2e2;color:#b91c1c;border:1px solid #fecaca;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;\">Decline</button><button style=\"padding:8px 16px;border-radius:8px;background:#16a34a;color:#fff;border:none;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;\">Approve Request</button></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
